exports[`skill - Snapshot Tests > renders successful skill load with detailed instructions 1`] = `
"⚙ Load skill systematic-debugging
  │  name: systematic-debugging
  │  # Systematic Debugging Skill
  │
  │  ## When to Use
  │
  │  Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing
  │  fixes.
  │
  │  ## Core Principles
  │
  │    * Evidence before assumptions
  │    * Reproduce before fixing
  │    * Understand before changing
  │
  │  ## Steps
  │
  │    1. Reproduce the issue
  │      2. Create minimal reproduction case
  │      3. Document exact steps
  │      4. Note environment details
  │    5. Gather evidence
  │      6. Read error messages carefully
  │      7. Check logs and stack traces
  │      8. Identify affected code paths
  │    9. Form hypothesis
  │      10. What could cause this?
  │      11. What evidence supports it?
  │      12. What would disprove it?
  │    13. Test hypothesis
  │      14. Add debug logging
  │      15. Use debugger breakpoints
  │      16. Write test cases
  │    17. Implement fix
  │      18. Address root cause
  │      19. Add regression tests
  │      20. Verify fix works
  │    21. Validate
  │      22. Run full test suite
  │      23. Test edge cases
  │      24. Document the fix
  └─ Completed"
`;

